A cautious reconstruction is $C_{\text{stack}}
\approx
C_{\mathrm{in}}\cup C_{\mathrm{on}},$ where $C_{\mathrm{in}}$ refers to capabilities inside brokerage activity and $C_{\mathrm{on}}$ refers to adjacent real estate activity, such as investing or wholesaling. The approximation sign matters. The transcript does not define a clean taxonomy of in and on, so the notation should remain a guide, not a doctrine.

